@startuml UC2_UserLogin_RASD
autonumber
title [UC2] User Login

' =======================================================
' ACTORS & SYSTEM
' =======================================================
actor "Registered User" as RU
participant "BBP system" as System

' =======================================================
' ENTRY CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over RU, System: Entry Condition: RU opens the BBP platform

' =======================================================
' INTERACTION FLOW
' =======================================================
RU -> System: clickSignIn()
System --> RU: displayLoginForm()

' Steps (a) and (b): Insertion of credentials
RU -> System: insertCredentials(nickname/email, password)

' Step (c): Verification
note right of System: System checks if data\nis correct

' =======================================================
' LOGIC: ALTERNATIVE PATHS
' =======================================================
alt Data is not correct (Exception)
    System --> RU: showError("Invalid credentials")
else Data is correct (Success)
    System -> System: authenticateUser()
    System --> RU: loginSuccessful()
end

' =======================================================
' EXIT CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over RU, System: Exit Condition: User successfully logged in

@enduml